ntfy.runv.club sends notifications to your phone or desktop, and works as
pub/sub between machines. Your topics start with your name.

  runv token ntfy                      get a token (once)
  t=$(cat ~/.config/runv/ntfy-token)
  curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $t" -d "backup done" https://ntfy.runv.club/you-alerts

Subscribe in the ntfy app (server https://ntfy.runv.club, log in with
the token) or with:  curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $t" https://ntfy.runv.club/you-alerts/json

Messages are kept for 12 hours.
